Note that Example 3 demonstrates parameterized native functions and System V AMD64 ABI calls.

To compute polynomial taking x as integer, coeff as integer returning integer,
  Let squared be x times x.
  Let term be squared times coeff.
  Let answer be term plus x times 3 plus 7.
  Return answer.
End function.

To compute kineticEnergy taking mass as integer, velocity as integer returning integer,
  Let vSquared be velocity times velocity.
  Let numerator be mass times vSquared.
  Return numerator divided by 2.
End function.

Display text of Eathon Native Functions and ABI Verification end text.

Call polynomial with 5, 4 into polyResult.
Display polyResult.

Call kineticEnergy with 12, 10 into energyResult.
Display energyResult.

Let combined be polyResult plus energyResult.
Display combined.
